    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae A Puzzle RPG where the more you teach, the stronger your AI becomes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlockWorld Ai</strong> is an AI-training puzzle RPG where you go on an adventure with a mysterious AI named <strong>Hoshihabito-kun</strong>, who learns how you <strong>solve puzzles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save your once-friendly companions who have turned hostile, your <strong>wisdom becomes your weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Game Features</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Train Your AI Through Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your AI watches and learns from how you move the blocks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The smarter it gets, the better it performs in boss battles\u2014solving puzzles on its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd22 Strategic Number Puzzle Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the numbers on the blocks to subtract and reach the target number: <strong>zero</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit zero and unleash a chain reaction! Match 3 to keep it going.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Diagonal Match Triggers Special Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align blocks diagonally through the center to activate character-specific skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your SP to unleash powerful ultimate attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e Collect Treasures &amp; Upgrade in the Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather cubes during your journey to unlock <strong>Treasures</strong>\u2014items that strengthen skills or grant unique effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 BRAKER System: One-Shot Finisher</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up power during combos and unleash a massive, satisfying strike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Battle Alongside Your Trained AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing a boss, your AI takes the lead\u2014applying the techniques it learned from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support it with your skills and guide it toward victory!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae A Puzzle RPG where the more you teach, the stronger your AI becomes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlockWorld Ai</strong> is an AI-training puzzle RPG where you go on an adventure with a mysterious AI named <strong>Hoshihabito-kun</strong>, who learns how you <strong>solve puzzles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save your once-friendly companions who have turned hostile, your <strong>wisdom becomes your weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Game Features</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Train Your AI Through Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your AI watches and learns from how you move the blocks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The smarter it gets, the better it performs in boss battles\u2014solving puzzles on its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd22 Strategic Number Puzzle Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the numbers on the blocks to subtract and reach the target number: <strong>zero</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit zero and unleash a chain reaction! Match 3 to keep it going.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Diagonal Match Triggers Special Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align blocks diagonally through the center to activate character-specific skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your SP to unleash powerful ultimate attacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e Collect Treasures &amp; Upgrade in the Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather cubes during your journey to unlock <strong>Treasures</strong>\u2014items that strengthen skills or grant unique effects.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 BRAKER System: One-Shot Finisher</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up power during combos and unleash a massive, satisfying strike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Battle Alongside Your Trained AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing a boss, your AI takes the lead\u2014applying the techniques it learned from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support it with your skills and guide it toward victory!</p>",
